WEBVTT

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.865
Hi, friends. Gani here. This is Include Someone New.

00:00:12.865 --> 00:00:17.731
Sit tall in your chair. Feet flat on the floor.

00:00:17.731 --> 00:00:20.650
Hands resting on your desk. Shoulders soft.

00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:23.569
Take one slow breath with me… and let it go.

00:00:23.569 --> 00:00:31.353
Think of a game, or a table, or a group of friends. Now think of the edge of it.

00:00:31.353 --> 00:00:40.111
Sometimes someone new stands at that edge. New to the class. New to the game. New to the table.

00:00:40.111 --> 00:00:47.896
Standing at the edge doesn't mean they want to stay there. Often, nobody has opened the way in.

00:00:47.896 --> 00:00:50.815
You can be the one who opens it. It takes one small, real thing.

00:00:50.815 --> 00:00:58.599
An invitation is specific. Not just "come play" floating by — a real place, offered.

00:00:58.599 --> 00:01:06.384
A seat: "There's a chair here. Want to sit with us?"

00:01:06.384 --> 00:01:14.168
A turn: "We're taking turns. You can have the next one."

00:01:14.168 --> 00:01:20.980
Or the plain words themselves: "Want to join us?"

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:25.845
You are not rescuing anyone. You are one person, offering another person a place. Equals.

00:01:25.845 --> 00:01:33.629
And here is the part that makes it a real invitation: the answer might be no.

00:01:33.629 --> 00:01:42.387
A no is allowed. Maybe not today. Maybe they are watching first. Watching is a way in, too.

00:01:42.387 --> 00:01:48.225
You can answer a no with a smile: "Okay. The seat is here if you want it."

00:01:48.225 --> 00:01:51.144
No pushing. No fixing. The door stays open, and so does your kindness.

00:01:51.144 --> 00:01:57.956
Notice. Offer a real place. Accept the answer. That is how someone new becomes someone who belongs.

00:01:57.956 --> 00:02:02.821
Shoulders soft. Let your body rest.

00:02:02.821 --> 00:02:06.713
Hands down. One more slow breath… and let it go.

00:02:06.713 --> 00:02:11.579
Eyes open. Look around your classroom.

00:02:11.579 --> 00:02:16.444
You're ready for what's next.
